cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "TechTide Swarm 357"
message: "If you reference this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
abstract: >-
  A Python multi-agent orchestration framework for Claude agents, organised as a
  357-role catalog across six business layers, with portable agent memory,
  enforced LLM cost control, human-in-the-loop approvals on shell commands, and
  durable checkpoints that can be resumed, cancelled, and replayed.
